Package: com.raulkong89.bottommicredirect
Name: iPhone 4S Bottom Mic Hardware Route
Version: 5.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: iOS 6.1.x iPhone 4S (N94) low-level VirtualAudio HAL override. Forces BuiltInMicSelection bit 0, which the exact iOS 6.1.3 N94 VirtualAudio binary identifies as the bottom/primary microphone. No MobileSubstrate hooks.
Maintainer: RaulKong89
Author: RaulKong89 / ChatGPT
Section: System
Depends: firmware (>= 6.0), firmware (<< 7.0)
Conflicts: com.raulkong89.bottommicredirect (<< 5.0.0)
Replaces: com.raulkong89.bottommicredirect (<< 5.0.0)
